#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/advanced-marks.page:17
msgid ""
"Marks are numbered 0-9. To select a mark to work with, choose the mark "
"number you would like to select by selecting the number in the <gui>Mark:</"
"gui> spin button, or by pressing <keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>0...9</key></"
"keyseq>."
msgstr ""
"Merka er nummererte 0–9. For å velje eit merke å arbeide med vel du talet i "
"talfeltet <gui>Merke:</gui>, eller du trykkjer "
"<keyseq><key>Ctrl</key><key>0...9</key></keyseq>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/advanced-marks.page:20
msgid "Setting marks"
msgstr "Setje merke"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/advanced-marks.page:21
msgid ""
"To set a mark, select the mark number you would like to set. Next, highlight "
"the data for which you would like to set a mark. Finally, click <gui>Set</"
"gui> to set that mark."
msgstr ""
"For å setje eit merke vel du først nummeret på merket. Deretter markerer du "
"dataa du vil setje merket på. Til slutt klikkar du <gui>Set</gui>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/advanced-marks.page:24
msgid "Jumping to marks"
msgstr "Hoppe til merke"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/advanced-marks.page:25
msgid ""
"To jump to a mark, select the mark number you would like to jump to. Then, "
"click <gui>Jump</gui> to jump to that mark. This will set the cursor "
"position to the starting point of that mark instantaneously."
msgstr ""
"For å hoppe til eit merke vel du nummeret på merket og klikkar "
"<gui>Hopp</gui>. Då flyttar markøren seg straks til starten av merket."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/advanced-marks.page:28
msgid "Deleting marks"
msgstr "Slette merke"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/advanced-marks.page:29
msgid ""
"To delete a mark, select the mark number you would like to delete. Then, "
"click <gui>Delete</gui> to delete that mark."
msgstr ""
"For å slette eit merke vel du nummeret på merket og klikkar "
"<gui>Slett</gui>."

#. (itstool) path: section/title
#: C/advanced-marks.page:32
msgid "Setting a custom color for a mark"
msgstr "Setje ein eigen farge på eit merke"

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/advanced-marks.page:33
msgid ""
"Marks have a default color which should make them stand out from other "
"highlighted items. However, you can also optionally set a custom color for a "
"mark if desired."
msgstr ""
"Merke har ein standardfarge som skal få dei til å skilje seg ut frå andre "
"utheva element. Du kan òg setje ein eigen farge på eit merke viss du vil."

#. (itstool) path: section/p
#: C/advanced-marks.page:34
msgid ""
"Custom colors can only be set after a mark has been created. Once a mark has "
"been created, click the color chooser button next to the <gui>Mark:</gui> "
